flowchart TD
    START([对局开始]) --> ROLL{随机判断<br/>random less than pressure_robot_rate?}
    
    ROLL -->|否| NORMAL[使用原有机器人逻辑<br/>固定时间加固定比例分数]
    ROLL -->|是| PRESSURE[启用紧咬机器人]
    
    PRESSURE --> INIT[随机生成达标分数<br/>qualify_score<br/>玩家不可见]
    
    INIT --> LOOP[每次加分检查点]
    
    LOOP --> CALC[计算目标分数<br/>target = player_score 减 随机分差]
    
    CALC --> COMPARE{target 大于 当前bot_score?}
    
    COMPARE -->|是| UPDATE[bot_score = target<br/>机器人紧咬追分]
    COMPARE -->|否| KEEP[bot_score保持不变<br/>只涨不跌]
    
    UPDATE --> ENDCHECK{对局结束?}
    KEEP --> ENDCHECK
    
    ENDCHECK -->|否| LOOP
    ENDCHECK -->|是| QUALIFY{player_score 大于等于 qualify_score?}
    
    QUALIFY -->|玩家达标| WIN[玩家获胜<br/>机器人故意少加分<br/>险胜体验]
    QUALIFY -->|玩家未达标| LOSE[机器人获胜<br/>最后时刻反超<br/>惜败体验]
    
    WIN --> END([对局结算])
    LOSE --> END
    NORMAL --> NORMAL_END([原逻辑结算])

    style START fill:#9C27B0,color:white
    style PRESSURE fill:#4CAF50,color:white
    style INIT fill:#00BCD4,color:white
    style QUALIFY fill:#FF9800,color:white
    style WIN fill:#2196F3,color:white
    style LOSE fill:#f44336,color:white
    style NORMAL fill:#607D8B,color:white
